{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/f8195188f1cf95079ec9fba20adfce32.poster.avif?t=1764135455\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/f8195188f1cf95079ec9fba20adfce32.webm?t=1764135455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/f8195188f1cf95079ec9fba20adfce32.mp4?t=1764135455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Shadow of the Rift: A Continent's Peace is Shattered</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land of Veridia, blessed with abundant life and rich resources, has known peace for generations. But that peace is shattered. From another dimension, a malevolent entity appears, tearing open dimensional rifts across the continent. From these rifts, it summons hordes of monsters, their minds and bodies twisted and corrupted by its vile magic. In an instant, Veridia is plunged into chaos and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of this turmoil, an ordinary young man from a small village, living a simple life of farming and hunting, awakens a dormant power within. To save Veridia and protect his home, he must take up the sword and accept his new destiny: to stand against this dark force and its legion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the journey to restore peace to the continent of Veridia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/37c4ee9a895e588493ac679adaf37d5c.poster.avif?t=1764135455\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/37c4ee9a895e588493ac679adaf37d5c.webm?t=1764135455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/37c4ee9a895e588493ac679adaf37d5c.mp4?t=1764135455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three Classes to Choose From</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pick one of three classes, each with its own special traits. As you go on adventures, you\u2019ll level up and improve your character's unique skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon and Skill System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the right weapons for your class and set up the skills that match your playstyle. The more you use a weapon or a skill, the stronger it becomes, giving you better stats and improved effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leveling and Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt monsters to gain levels, and choose which stats to increase as your character grows. You can also upgrade your weapons and armor to make your character much stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/ac795f2adc34dfba00fac439f6f41f11.poster.avif?t=1764135455\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/ac795f2adc34dfba00fac439f6f41f11.webm?t=1764135455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/ac795f2adc34dfba00fac439f6f41f11.mp4?t=1764135455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides the items you get from monsters, you can find different materials in the world. Use them to craft special, rare items to make your character stand out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/e7cc1a93dc9a013a8bf7f807d20b3f8f.poster.avif?t=1764135455\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/e7cc1a93dc9a013a8bf7f807d20b3f8f.webm?t=1764135455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/e7cc1a93dc9a013a8bf7f807d20b3f8f.mp4?t=1764135455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take Over Rifts and Expand Your Area</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will appear from things called &quot;Dimensional Rifts.&quot; You can fight to capture these rifts and expand the area you control. Once you capture a rift, you can use it to fast travel around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow and Get Stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to take over enemy land to make your territory bigger, and you\u2019ll also need to defend your areas from enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/extras/2103a45d7f5c3ca96b8d1f3369feaeae.avif?t=1764135455\" width=760 height=642 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932010?t=1764135455","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932010?t=1764135455","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/dd30f9dcf2f439217f440a56a2fefca4bef52b1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764135455","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932010/dd30f9dcf2f439217f440a56a2f